1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. e5 Nfd7 5. f4 c5 6. dxc5 Bxc5 7. Qg4 g6 8. h4 h5 9. Qh3 Qb6 10. Nf3 Nc6 11. Bd3 Ne7 12. g4 Be3 13. Bxe3 Qxe3+ 14. Ne2 Nc5 15. Rd1 Bd7 16. Qg2 Rc8 17. Rh3 Nxd3+ 18. Rxd3 Qe4 19. Kd1 Qb4 20. Rb3 Qc4 21. Nfd4 Qc7 22. Rhc3 Qb8 23. Nb5 Bxb5 24. Rxb5 Rxc3 25. Nxc3 a6 26. Rb3 Nc6 27. Na4 Qa7 28. Rb6 Ke7 29. gxh5 Rxh5 30. Qf2 Kf8 31. Nc5 d4 32. c3 Kg7 33. Nd7 dxc3 34. Qc5 Rh8 35. Rxc6 Qxc5 36. Rxc5 {Adjudicated a draw by Hoffer. Sources: Chess Monthly, Vol. 15, p239; London Evening Standard, 19 March 1894} (36. Rxc5 cxb2 37. Kc2 Rxh4 38. Rc4 g5 39. Nf6 gxf4 40. Rxf4 Rxf4 41. Nh5+ Kg6 42. Nxf4+ Kf5 43. Nd3 Ke4 44. Nxb2 Kxe5 {was Hoffer's adjudication analysis}) 1/2-1/2

